        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Work table (<i>Table à ouvrage</i>), French, 1776, veneered in tulipwood and set with porcelain and gilt bronze mounts; with the stamp of  Martin Carlin. Possibly commissioned by Simon-Philippe Poirier and Dominique Daguerre."@en ;
